# Cargo build artifacts (non-standard)
**/target/

# Evidence: verification corpus stays local, not in git
#
# The evidence/ tree (E01–E124 contracts, probes, results) is the project's
# verification corpus. Per evidence/README.md it must be preserved locally,
# but it is deliberately NOT tracked by git: probes and build artifacts are
# regenerable verification noise, and keeping the whole tree out of the
# repository keeps it focused on the crate itself. The contracts
# (evidence/README.md, evidence/contracts.md) describe what was verified and
# how to re-run the probes.
/evidence/

# Reasonix desktop session metadata (local tool state)
.reasonix/
world_events.log
redis_like.aof
packets.pcap

redis_like_aof_writer_*.aof
